{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1000_p", "source_sha256": "975606d094a09c042e42d085c71ffc04429643773653cecbe8f9c54a000b0f7a", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、海辺に\nやってきた。ロコはかなり張り切っているみたいだな）", "zh": "（正在为写真杂志《偶像写真！！》拍摄，来到了海边。ROCO似乎干劲十足啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "dc825292a0d762b223000741ec4c31260aaa0578b08d12db4f61b5b6247d6e76", "ja": "ふっふっふ……。{$P$}、\nついに撮影日がやってきましたね！", "zh": "呵呵呵……。{$P$}，终于到拍摄日了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
