{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "ac930ab749bd97736801dcfe3155f01e9f9994afe74e6d0467868fa1fe7fe902", "ja": "はい♪　実はいくつかアイディアを考えてきたんです。\n{$P$}、聞いてくれますか？", "zh": "好的♪其实我想了好几个点子。{$P$}，您愿意听听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
