{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "6fa0482c5c6a845fd018bcc10106a7f8e8cf8ac43e450df4c62dbfe1b93a64a2", "ja": "イエスです！　まず一つ目のアイディアは……\n『ビッグシャーク・イーティング』です！", "zh": "没错！首先，第一个创意是……\n《大鲨鱼进食》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2b08ea6b8079208fcc592228aab0b344b12ccdf592ca57d804c05ae3c8aa4f39", "ja": "……ビッグシャーク、イーティング？", "zh": "……大鲨鱼进食？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "5bb8ae8be27b49792bf8831973b6a21dc702aea22a352d6db6746f4102bc8814", "ja": "はい。ロコよりもビッグなシャークのヘッドを置いて、\nロコが食べられそうになってるシーンを撮影します！", "zh": "是的。放一个比ROCO还要大的鲨鱼头，拍摄ROCO即将被吃掉的场景！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "58c23df54d6be8f9bb6f77f6d985c6191adcdae0d7556167e47ec4e78c042dfa", "ja": "キュートなワンピースとフェロシティなシャークの\nコントラストが、生死のメタファーに……。", "zh": "可爱的连衣裙与凶猛鲨鱼的反差，将成为生死的隐喻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1010_p", "source_sha256": "21ed97e70960e0445b876d575f0b1a82dc82a20939a430a3b27c631591584cd4", "ja": "待った待った！　面白いアイディアだけど、\nサメの頭がすぐに用意できるかわからないな……。", "zh": "等等等等！虽然是个有趣的想法，但不知道能不能马上准备好鲨鱼头……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "7e73856c60bbfa5a56ccb6cc5a380f03013a3ba646a531c79fb343c829105919", "ja": "むう、そうですか……。それなら、\n次のアイディアがベストプランかもですね。", "zh": "唔……这样啊……那样的话，下一个点子或许才是最佳方案呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
