{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "7b3a5598f69aa901dfd0dca1bc9a57bee9650e24f79bca896a3a77155c0a739f", "ja": "ザッツライトです、{$P$}！\nCGでバーチャルレインを降らせて……。", "zh": "没错，{$P$}！\n用CG让虚拟的雨降下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "e355e166bdd279385311d0f91f706c3356a783d94d66ec07bc08ba79496f5e2f", "ja": "モノクロのトーンで、センチメンタルなニュアンスを\n出せれば、衣装にマッチしたフォトになると思うの！", "zh": "如果能用黑白色调营造出感伤的氛围，我觉得就能拍出与服装相称的照片了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0373_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5ec12954de182d38e56dc6c5a0458e4fa3d00e8cf9400498a230bcd323b5e5a9", "ja": "おお！　アート感のあるロコらしい写真になりそうだ。\nよし、早速相談してみよう！", "zh": "哦哦！这会是一张很有艺术感、很像ROCO风格的照片呢。\n好，马上去商量一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
